    "sections": {
        "description": "<p><strong>Hiring Center</strong> is a modern, flexible WordPress plugin that allows you to easily build a complete <strong>job board</strong> or <strong>careers page</strong> on your website. Designed to work seamlessly with the WordPress Block Editor and Full Site Editing (FSE), this plugin gives you full control over your recruitment process.</p>\n<p>Ideal for startups, businesses, HR departments, and recruitment agencies looking to advertise job openings and receive candidate applications through a dedicated platform.</p>\n<p><strong>Key Benefits:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Set up a fully customizable job portal in minutes.</li>\n<li>Integrate directly into your existing WordPress website.</li>\n<li>Enhance visibility with SEO-friendly job listings and schema support.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Perfect for:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Company career pages</li>\n<li>HR and recruitment teams</li>\n<li>Remote and hybrid job listings</li>\n<li>Agencies and freelancers building job board websites</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Features</h3>\n<p><strong>Flexible Job Specifications</strong><br />\nCreate unlimited custom job attributes such as employment type (full-time, part-time), workplace type (remote, hybrid), salary range, qualifications, and more. Tailor fields to match your business needs.</p>\n<p><strong>Custom Application Links</strong><br />\nEasily add external or internal application URLs to each job listing. Redirect candidates to an external ATS or a contact form of your choice.</p>\n<p><strong>Built for Block Editor &amp; Full Site Editing (FSE)</strong><br />\nDesigned to fully support modern WordPress block themes. Take advantage of the Block Editor&#8217;s full flexibility for custom layouts.</p>\n<p><strong>Custom Blocks &amp; Block Patterns</strong><br />\nUse intuitive drag-and-drop tools to display job listings, filters, and call-to-actions using pre-built blocks and layout patterns.</p>\n<p><strong>Advanced Filtering with Query Loop</strong><br />\nLet users filter job listings by category, location, job type, and more. Build dynamic search sections to help candidates quickly find relevant openings.</p>\n<p><strong>Schema.org Structured Data Integration</strong><br />\nEnhance SEO with built-in support for the <a href=\"https://schema.org/JobPosting\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">JobPosting schema</a>. Includes 25 predefined properties to help listings appear as rich results in search engines.</p>\n<p><strong>Custom Post Type: &#8220;Job&#8221;</strong><br />\nManage job listings via a custom post type. Add, edit, and delete job posts directly from the WordPress dashboard.</p>\n<p><strong>&#8220;Careers&#8221; Theme Integration</strong><br />\nUse the free <a href=\"https://wordpress.org/themes/careers/\" rel=\"ugc\">Careers WordPress Theme</a> designed specifically for Hiring Center. It’s optimized for Full Site Editing and provides a ready-to-go structure for building your careers site in no time.</p>\n",
        "installation": "<ol>\n<li>Upload the plugin files to the <code>/wp-content/plugins/hiring-center</code> directory or install directly through the WordPress plugin repository.</li>\n<li>Activate the plugin via the &#8216;Plugins&#8217; menu in WordPress.</li>\n<li>Navigate to the &#8220;Jobs&#8221; section in your admin panel to begin creating job listings.</li>\n<li>Use the Site Editor to insert the included blocks or block patterns into your pages.</li>\n</ol>\n",
        "faq": "\n<dt id='is%20hiring%20center%20compatible%20with%20full%20site%20editing%3F'>\nIs Hiring Center compatible with Full Site Editing?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>Yes! Hiring Center is fully compatible with block themes and FSE.</p>\n</p>\n<dt id='can%20i%20customize%20job%20fields%3F'>\nCan I customize job fields?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>Absolutely. You can define and manage unlimited custom job specifications to match your hiring needs.</p>\n</p>\n<dt id='is%20it%20seo-friendly%3F'>\nIs it SEO-friendly?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>Yes. The plugin includes schema.org JobPosting support for rich search result snippets.</p>\n</p>\n<dt id='does%20it%20support%20external%20application%20systems%3F'>\nDoes it support external application systems?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>Yes, you can add custom &#8220;apply&#8221; URLs to redirect applicants to external platforms or forms.</p>\n</p>\n\n",
        "changelog": "<h4>1.6.3 (2025-11-28)</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Compatibility with WordPress 6.9 confirmed</li>\n<li>Dependencies updated</li>\n<li>Code improvements</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.6.2 (2025-05-08)</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Plugin links and references to Teydea Studio updated</li>\n<li>Dependencies updated</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.6.1 (2025-04-04)</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Compatibility with WordPress 6.8 confirmed</li>\n<li>Issue of requesting the translated string too early fixed</li>\n<li>Dependencies updated</li>\n<li>Code improvements</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.6.0 (2025-02-21)</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Job specification fields reordering implemented</li>\n<li>Dependencies updated</li>\n<li>Code improvements</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.5.0 (2024-11-20)</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Custom capabilities for managing the plugin settings implemented</li>\n<li>Compatibility with WordPress 6.7 confirmed</li>\n<li>Dependencies updated</li>\n<li>Code improvements</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.4.1 (2024-11-04)</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Update the plugin slug and data prefix</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.4.0 (2024-10-31)</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Rename the plugin to Hiring Center</li>\n<li>Dependencies updated</li>\n<li>Code improvements</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.3.3 (2024-10-25)</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>JS dependency map and tree-shaking optimized</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.3.2 (2024-10-17)</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Add link to the plugin page on TeydeaStudio.com</li>\n<li>Dependencies updated</li>\n<li>Code improvements</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.3.1 (2024-10-11)</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Language files updated for Polish translation</li>\n<li>Language mapping file added for easier generation of JSON translation files</li>\n<li>Plugin readme file updated</li>\n<li>Small code improvements</li>\n</ul>\n<p>(For older records, see the <code>changelog.txt</code> file).</p>\n"
    },
    "short_description": "Create a powerful job portal and professional career page directly within WordPress. Simplify your recruitment workflow and manage job listings.",
    "description": "<p><strong>Hiring Center</strong> is a modern, flexible WordPress plugin that allows you to easily build a complete <strong>job board</strong> or <strong>careers page</strong> on your website. Designed to work seamlessly with the WordPress Block Editor and Full Site Editing (FSE), this plugin gives you full control over your recruitment process.</p>\n<p>Ideal for startups, businesses, HR departments, and recruitment agencies looking to advertise job openings and receive candidate applications through a dedicated platform.</p>\n<p><strong>Key Benefits:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Set up a fully customizable job portal in minutes.</li>\n<li>Integrate directly into your existing WordPress website.</li>\n<li>Enhance visibility with SEO-friendly job listings and schema support.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Perfect for:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Company career pages</li>\n<li>HR and recruitment teams</li>\n<li>Remote and hybrid job listings</li>\n<li>Agencies and freelancers building job board websites</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Features</h3>\n<p><strong>Flexible Job Specifications</strong><br />\nCreate unlimited custom job attributes such as employment type (full-time, part-time), workplace type (remote, hybrid), salary range, qualifications, and more. Tailor fields to match your business needs.</p>\n<p><strong>Custom Application Links</strong><br />\nEasily add external or internal application URLs to each job listing. Redirect candidates to an external ATS or a contact form of your choice.</p>\n<p><strong>Built for Block Editor &amp; Full Site Editing (FSE)</strong><br />\nDesigned to fully support modern WordPress block themes. Take advantage of the Block Editor&#8217;s full flexibility for custom layouts.</p>\n<p><strong>Custom Blocks &amp; Block Patterns</strong><br />\nUse intuitive drag-and-drop tools to display job listings, filters, and call-to-actions using pre-built blocks and layout patterns.</p>\n<p><strong>Advanced Filtering with Query Loop</strong><br />\nLet users filter job listings by category, location, job type, and more. Build dynamic search sections to help candidates quickly find relevant openings.</p>\n<p><strong>Schema.org Structured Data Integration</strong><br />\nEnhance SEO with built-in support for the <a href=\"https://schema.org/JobPosting\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">JobPosting schema</a>. Includes 25 predefined properties to help listings appear as rich results in search engines.</p>\n<p><strong>Custom Post Type: &#8220;Job&#8221;</strong><br />\nManage job listings via a custom post type. Add, edit, and delete job posts directly from the WordPress dashboard.</p>\n<p><strong>&#8220;Careers&#8221; Theme Integration</strong><br />\nUse the free <a href=\"https://wordpress.org/themes/careers/\" rel=\"ugc\">Careers WordPress Theme</a> designed specifically for Hiring Center. It’s optimized for Full Site Editing and provides a ready-to-go structure for building your careers site in no time.</p>\n",
